{"n":45,"name":"Al-Jathiyah","nameAr":"الجاثية","meaning":"The Crouching","ayahs":37,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":25,"ar":"حمٓ","en":"Ḥā, Meem.","w":[{"ar":"حمٓ","tr":"hha-meem","en":"Ha Meem"}]},{"n":2,"juz":25,"ar":"تَنزِيلُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْحَكِيمِ","en":"The revelation of the Book is from Allāh, the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[{"ar":"تَنزِيلُ","tr":"tanzīlu","en":"(The) revelation","root":"نزل","lem":"تَنزِيل"},{"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","tr":"l-kitābi","en":"(of) the Book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"(is) from"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزِ","tr":"l-ʿazīzi","en":"the All-Mighty","root":"عزز","lem":"عَزِيز"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمِ","tr":"l-ḥakīmi","en":"the All-Wise","root":"حكم","lem":"حَكِيم"}]},{"n":3,"juz":25,"ar":"إِنَّ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en":"Indeed, within the heavens and earth are signs for the believers.","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"wal-arḍi","en":"and the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","tr":"laāyātin","en":"surely (are) Signs","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","tr":"lil'mu'minīna","en":"for the believers","root":"أمن","lem":"مُؤْمِن"}]},{"n":4,"juz":25,"ar":"وَفِى خَلْقِكُمْ وَمَا يَبُثُّ مِن دَآبَّةٍ ءَايَـٰتٌ لِّقَوْمٍ يُوقِنُونَ","en":"And in the creation of yourselves and what He disperses of moving creatures are signs for people who are certain [in faith].","w":[{"ar":"وَفِى","tr":"wafī","en":"And in"},{"ar":"خَلْقِكُمْ","tr":"khalqikum","en":"your creation","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلْق"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and what"},{"ar":"يَبُثُّ","tr":"yabuthu","en":"He disperses","root":"بثث","lem":"بَثَّ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"دَآبَّةٍ","tr":"dābbatin","en":"(the) moving creatures","root":"دبب","lem":"دابَّة"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتٌۭ","tr":"āyātun","en":"(are) Signs","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","tr":"liqawmin","en":"for a people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"يُوقِنُونَ","tr":"yūqinūna","en":"who are certain","root":"يقن","lem":"يُوقِنُ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":25,"ar":"وَٱخْتِلَـٰفِ ٱلَّيْلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِ وَمَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مِن رِّزْقٍ فَأَحْيَا بِهِ ٱلْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ مَوْتِهَا وَتَصْرِيفِ ٱلرِّيَـٰحِ ءَايَـٰتٌ لِّقَوْمٍ يَعْقِلُونَ","en":"And [in] the alternation of night and day and [in] what Allāh sends down from the sky of provision [i.e., rain] and gives life thereby to the earth after its lifelessness and [in His] directing of the winds are signs for a people who reason.","w":[{"ar":"وَٱخْتِلَـٰفِ","tr":"wa-ikh'tilāfi","en":"And (in the) alternation","root":"خلف","lem":"اخْتِلاف"},{"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","tr":"al-layli","en":"(of) the night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْل"},{"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ","tr":"wal-nahāri","en":"and the day","root":"نهر","lem":"نَهار"},{"ar":"وَمَآ","tr":"wamā","en":"and what"},{"ar":"أَنزَلَ","tr":"anzala","en":"Allah sends down","root":"نزل","lem":"أَنزَلَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah sends down","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"from"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"l-samāi","en":"the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"رِّزْقٍۢ","tr":"riz'qin","en":"(the) provision","root":"رزق","lem":"رِزْق"},{"ar":"فَأَحْيَا","tr":"fa-aḥyā","en":"and gives life","root":"حيي","lem":"أَحْيا"},{"ar":"بِهِ","tr":"bihi","en":"thereby"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","tr":"l-arḍa","en":"(to) the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"بَعْدَ","tr":"baʿda","en":"after","root":"بعد","lem":"بَعْد"},{"ar":"مَوْتِهَا","tr":"mawtihā","en":"its death","root":"موت","lem":"مَوْت"},{"ar":"وَتَصْرِيفِ","tr":"wataṣrīfi","en":"and (in) directing","root":"صرف","lem":"تَصْرِيف"},{"ar":"ٱلرِّيَـٰحِ","tr":"l-riyāḥi","en":"(the) winds","root":"روح","lem":"رِيح"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتٌۭ","tr":"āyātun","en":"(are) Signs","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","tr":"liqawmin","en":"for a people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"يَعْقِلُونَ","tr":"yaʿqilūna","en":"who reason","root":"عقل","lem":"عَقَلُ"}]},{"n":6,"juz":25,"ar":"تِلْكَ ءَايَـٰتُ ٱللَّهِ نَتْلُوهَا عَلَيْكَ بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ فَبِأَىِّ حَدِيثٍۭ بَعْدَ ٱللَّهِ وَءَايَـٰتِهِۦ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en":"These are the verses of Allāh which We recite to you in truth. Then in what statement after Allāh and His verses will they believe?","w":[{"ar":"تِلْكَ","tr":"til'ka","en":"These"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُ","tr":"āyātu","en":"(are the) Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"نَتْلُوهَا","tr":"natlūhā","en":"We recite them","root":"تلو","lem":"تَلَى"},{"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","tr":"ʿalayka","en":"to you"},{"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","tr":"bil-ḥaqi","en":"in truth","root":"حقق","lem":"حَقّ"},{"ar":"فَبِأَىِّ","tr":"fabi-ayyi","en":"Then in what","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"حَدِيثٍۭ","tr":"ḥadīthin","en":"statement","root":"حدث","lem":"حَدِيث"},{"ar":"بَعْدَ","tr":"baʿda","en":"after","root":"بعد","lem":"بَعْد"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","tr":"waāyātihi","en":"and His Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","tr":"yu'minūna","en":"will they believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"}]},{"n":7,"juz":25,"ar":"وَيْلٌ لِّكُلِّ أَفَّاكٍ أَثِيمٍ","en":"Woe to every sinful liar","w":[{"ar":"وَيْلٌۭ","tr":"waylun","en":"Woe"},{"ar":"لِّكُلِّ","tr":"likulli","en":"to every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"أَفَّاكٍ","tr":"affākin","en":"liar","root":"أفك","lem":"أَفّاك"},{"ar":"أَثِيمٍۢ","tr":"athīmin","en":"sinful","root":"أثم","lem":"أَثِيم"}]},{"n":8,"juz":25,"ar":"يَسْمَعُ ءَايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِ ثُمَّ يُصِرُّ مُسْتَكْبِرًا كَأَن لَّمْ يَسْمَعْهَا ۖ فَبَشِّرْهُ بِعَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ","en":"Who hears the verses of Allāh recited to him, then persists arrogantly as if he had not heard them. So give him tidings of a painful punishment.","w":[{"ar":"يَسْمَعُ","tr":"yasmaʿu","en":"Who hears","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِ","tr":"āyāti","en":"(the) Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"تُتْلَىٰ","tr":"tut'lā","en":"recited","root":"تلو","lem":"تَلَى"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","tr":"ʿalayhi","en":"to him"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"then"},{"ar":"يُصِرُّ","tr":"yuṣirru","en":"persists","root":"صرر","lem":"أَصَرُّ"},{"ar":"مُسْتَكْبِرًۭا","tr":"mus'takbiran","en":"arrogantly","root":"كبر","lem":"مُسْتَكْبِر"},{"ar":"كَأَن","tr":"ka-an","en":"as if"},{"ar":"لَّمْ","tr":"lam","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَسْمَعْهَا ۖ","tr":"yasmaʿhā","en":"he heard them","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"فَبَشِّرْهُ","tr":"fabashir'hu","en":"So give him tidings","root":"بشر","lem":"بُشِّرَ"},{"ar":"بِعَذَابٍ","tr":"biʿadhābin","en":"(of) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"أَلِيمٍۢ","tr":"alīmin","en":"painful","root":"ألم","lem":"أَلِيم"}]},{"n":9,"juz":25,"ar":"وَإِذَا عَلِمَ مِنْ ءَايَـٰتِنَا شَيْـًٔا ٱتَّخَذَهَا هُزُوًا ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُّهِينٌ","en":"And when he knows anything of Our verses, he takes them in ridicule. Those will have a humiliating punishment.","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"عَلِمَ","tr":"ʿalima","en":"he knows","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"},{"ar":"مِنْ","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا","tr":"āyātinā","en":"Our Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"شَيْـًٔا","tr":"shayan","en":"anything","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"ٱتَّخَذَهَا","tr":"ittakhadhahā","en":"he takes them","root":"أخذ","lem":"اتَّخَذَ"},{"ar":"هُزُوًا ۚ","tr":"huzuwan","en":"(in) ridicule","root":"هزأ","lem":"هُزُو"},{"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","tr":"ulāika","en":"Those "},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"for them"},{"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","tr":"ʿadhābun","en":"(is) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"مُّهِينٌۭ","tr":"muhīnun","en":"humiliating","root":"هون","lem":"مُهِين"}]},{"n":10,"juz":25,"ar":"مِّن وَرَآئِهِمْ جَهَنَّمُ ۖ وَلَا يُغْنِى عَنْهُم مَّا كَسَبُوا۟ شَيْـًٔا وَلَا مَا ٱتَّخَذُوا۟ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ أَوْلِيَآءَ ۖ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","en":"Before them is Hell, and what they had earned will not avail them at all nor what they had taken besides Allāh as allies. And they will have a great punishment.","w":[{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"Before them"},{"ar":"وَرَآئِهِمْ","tr":"warāihim","en":"Before them","root":"وري","lem":"وَراء"},{"ar":"جَهَنَّمُ ۖ","tr":"jahannamu","en":"(is) Hell"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"يُغْنِى","tr":"yugh'nī","en":"will avail","root":"غني","lem":"أَغْنَتْ"},{"ar":"عَنْهُم","tr":"ʿanhum","en":"them"},{"ar":"مَّا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"كَسَبُوا۟","tr":"kasabū","en":"they had earned","root":"كسب","lem":"كَسَبَ"},{"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","tr":"shayan","en":"anything","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","tr":"ittakhadhū","en":"they had taken","root":"أخذ","lem":"اتَّخَذَ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"besides"},{"ar":"دُونِ","tr":"dūni","en":"besides","root":"دون","lem":"دُون"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَ ۖ","tr":"awliyāa","en":"(as) protectors","root":"ولي","lem":"وَلِيّ"},{"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","tr":"walahum","en":"And for them"},{"ar":"عَذَابٌ","tr":"ʿadhābun","en":"(is) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"عَظِيمٌ","tr":"ʿaẓīmun","en":"great","root":"عظم","lem":"عَظِيم"}]},{"n":11,"juz":25,"ar":"هَـٰذَا هُدًى ۖ وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ رَبِّهِمْ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مِّن رِّجْزٍ أَلِيمٌ","en":"This [Qur’ān] is guidance. And those who have disbelieved in the verses of their Lord will have a painful punishment of foul nature.","w":[{"ar":"هَـٰذَا","tr":"hādhā","en":"This"},{"ar":"هُدًۭى ۖ","tr":"hudan","en":"(is) guidance","root":"هدي","lem":"هُدًى"},{"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"wa-alladhīna","en":"And those who"},{"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","tr":"kafarū","en":"disbelieve","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","tr":"biāyāti","en":"in (the) Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","tr":"rabbihim","en":"(of) their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"for them"},{"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","tr":"ʿadhābun","en":"(is) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"رِّجْزٍ","tr":"rij'zin","en":"filth","root":"رجز","lem":"رِجْز"},{"ar":"أَلِيمٌ","tr":"alīmun","en":"painful","root":"ألم","lem":"أَلِيم"}]},{"n":12,"juz":25,"ar":"۞ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِى سَخَّرَ لَكُمُ ٱلْبَحْرَ لِتَجْرِىَ ٱلْفُلْكُ فِيهِ بِأَمْرِهِۦ وَلِتَبْتَغُوا۟ مِن فَضْلِهِۦ وَلَعَلَّكُمْ تَشْكُرُونَ","en":"It is Allāh who subjected to you the sea so that ships may sail upon it by His command and that you may seek of His bounty; and perhaps you will be grateful.","w":[{"ar":"۞ ٱللَّهُ","tr":"al-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","tr":"alladhī","en":"(is) the One Who"},{"ar":"سَخَّرَ","tr":"sakhara","en":"subjected","root":"سخر","lem":"سَخَّرَ"},{"ar":"لَكُمُ","tr":"lakumu","en":"to you"},{"ar":"ٱلْبَحْرَ","tr":"l-baḥra","en":"the sea","root":"بحر","lem":"بَحْر"},{"ar":"لِتَجْرِىَ","tr":"litajriya","en":"that may sail","root":"جري","lem":"جَرَيْ"},{"ar":"ٱلْفُلْكُ","tr":"l-ful'ku","en":"the ships","root":"فلك","lem":"فُلْك"},{"ar":"فِيهِ","tr":"fīhi","en":"therein"},{"ar":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ","tr":"bi-amrihi","en":"by His Command","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"},{"ar":"وَلِتَبْتَغُوا۟","tr":"walitabtaghū","en":"and that you may seek","root":"بغي","lem":"ابْتَغَى"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"فَضْلِهِۦ","tr":"faḍlihi","en":"His Bounty","root":"فضل","lem":"فَضْل"},{"ar":"وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","tr":"walaʿallakum","en":"and that you may"},{"ar":"تَشْكُرُونَ","tr":"tashkurūna","en":"give thanks","root":"شكر","lem":"شَكَرَ"}]},{"n":13,"juz":25,"ar":"وَسَخَّرَ لَكُم مَّا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ جَمِيعًا مِّنْهُ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en":"And He has subjected to you whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth - all from Him. Indeed in that are signs for a people who give thought.","w":[{"ar":"وَسَخَّرَ","tr":"wasakhara","en":"And He has subjected","root":"سخر","lem":"سَخَّرَ"},{"ar":"لَكُم","tr":"lakum","en":"to you"},{"ar":"مَّا","tr":"mā","en":"whatever"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(is) in"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and whatever"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(is) in"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth ","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا","tr":"jamīʿan","en":"all","root":"جمع","lem":"جَمِيع"},{"ar":"مِّنْهُ ۚ","tr":"min'hu","en":"from Him"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"that"},{"ar":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","tr":"laāyātin","en":"surely are Signs","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","tr":"liqawmin","en":"for a people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","tr":"yatafakkarūna","en":"who give thought","root":"فكر","lem":"يَتَفَكَّرُ"}]},{"n":14,"juz":25,"ar":"قُل لِّلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ يَغْفِرُوا۟ لِلَّذِينَ لَا يَرْجُونَ أَيَّامَ ٱللَّهِ لِيَجْزِىَ قَوْمًۢا بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَكْسِبُونَ","en":"Say, [O Muḥammad], to those who have believed that they [should] forgive those who expect not the days of Allāh [i.e., of His retribution] so that He may recompense a people for what they used to earn.","w":[{"ar":"قُل","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"لِّلَّذِينَ","tr":"lilladhīna","en":"to those who"},{"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","tr":"āmanū","en":"believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"يَغْفِرُوا۟","tr":"yaghfirū","en":"(to) forgive","root":"غفر","lem":"غَفَرَ"},{"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","tr":"lilladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(do) not"},{"ar":"يَرْجُونَ","tr":"yarjūna","en":"hope","root":"رجو","lem":"يَرْجُوا۟"},{"ar":"أَيَّامَ","tr":"ayyāma","en":"(for the) days","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"لِيَجْزِىَ","tr":"liyajziya","en":"that He may recompense","root":"جزي","lem":"جَزَى"},{"ar":"قَوْمًۢا","tr":"qawman","en":"a people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"بِمَا","tr":"bimā","en":"for what"},{"ar":"كَانُوا۟","tr":"kānū","en":"they used to","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"يَكْسِبُونَ","tr":"yaksibūna","en":"earn","root":"كسب","lem":"كَسَبَ"}]},{"n":15,"juz":25,"ar":"مَنْ عَمِلَ صَـٰلِحًا فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ وَمَنْ أَسَآءَ فَعَلَيْهَا ۖ ثُمَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكُمْ تُرْجَعُونَ","en":"Whoever does a good deed - it is for himself; and whoever does evil - it is against it [i.e., the self or soul]. Then to your Lord you will be returned.","w":[{"ar":"مَنْ","tr":"man","en":"Whoever"},{"ar":"عَمِلَ","tr":"ʿamila","en":"does","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"},{"ar":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","tr":"ṣāliḥan","en":"a righteous deed","root":"صلح","lem":"صالِح"},{"ar":"فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","tr":"falinafsihi","en":"then it is for his soul","root":"نفس","lem":"نَفْس"},{"ar":"وَمَنْ","tr":"waman","en":"and whoever"},{"ar":"أَسَآءَ","tr":"asāa","en":"does evil","root":"سوأ","lem":"أَساءَ"},{"ar":"فَعَلَيْهَا ۖ","tr":"faʿalayhā","en":"then it (is) against it"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"إِلَىٰ","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"رَبِّكُمْ","tr":"rabbikum","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"تُرْجَعُونَ","tr":"tur'jaʿūna","en":"you will be returned","root":"رجع","lem":"رَجَعَ"}]},{"n":16,"juz":25,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ ءَاتَيْنَا بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَٱلْحُكْمَ وَٱلنُّبُوَّةَ وَرَزَقْنَـٰهُم مِّنَ ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ وَفَضَّلْنَـٰهُمْ عَلَى ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en":"And We did certainly give the Children of Israel the Scripture and judgement and prophethood, and We provided them with good things and preferred them over the worlds.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","tr":"walaqad","en":"And certainly"},{"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَا","tr":"ātaynā","en":"We gave","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"بَنِىٓ","tr":"banī","en":"(the) Children of Israel","root":"بني","lem":"بُنَىّ"},{"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","tr":"is'rāīla","en":"(the) Children of Israel"},{"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","tr":"l-kitāba","en":"the Book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"وَٱلْحُكْمَ","tr":"wal-ḥuk'ma","en":"and the wisdom","root":"حكم","lem":"حُكْم"},{"ar":"وَٱلنُّبُوَّةَ","tr":"wal-nubuwata","en":"and the Prophethood","root":"نبأ","lem":"نُبُوَّة"},{"ar":"وَرَزَقْنَـٰهُم","tr":"warazaqnāhum","en":"and We provided them","root":"رزق","lem":"رَزَقَ"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ","tr":"l-ṭayibāti","en":"the good things","root":"طيب","lem":"طَيِّبَة"},{"ar":"وَفَضَّلْنَـٰهُمْ","tr":"wafaḍḍalnāhum","en":"and We preferred them","root":"فضل","lem":"فَضَّلَ"},{"ar":"عَلَى","tr":"ʿalā","en":"over"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","tr":"l-ʿālamīna","en":"the worlds","root":"علم","lem":"عالَم"}]},{"n":17,"juz":25,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُم بَيِّنَـٰتٍ مِّنَ ٱلْأَمْرِ ۖ فَمَا ٱخْتَلَفُوٓا۟ إِلَّا مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَهُمُ ٱلْعِلْمُ بَغْيًۢا بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ يَقْضِى بَيْنَهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ فِيمَا كَانُوا۟ فِيهِ يَخْتَلِفُونَ","en":"And We gave them clear proofs of the matter [of religion]. And they did not differ except after knowledge had come to them - out of jealous animosity between themselves. Indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.","w":[{"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُم","tr":"waātaynāhum","en":"And We gave them","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","tr":"bayyinātin","en":"clear proofs","root":"بين","lem":"بَيِّنَة"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرِ ۖ","tr":"l-amri","en":"the matter","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"},{"ar":"فَمَا","tr":"famā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"ٱخْتَلَفُوٓا۟","tr":"ik