kthara","en":"most","root":"كثر","lem":"أَكْثَر"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","tr":"l-nāsi","en":"(of) the people","root":"أنس","lem":"ناس"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(do) not"},{"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","tr":"yaʿlamūna","en":"know","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"}]},{"n":27,"juz":25,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَيَوْمَ تَقُومُ ٱلسَّاعَةُ يَوْمَئِذٍ يَخْسَرُ ٱلْمُبْطِلُونَ","en":"And to Allāh belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth. And the Day the Hour appears - that Day the falsifiers will lose.","w":[{"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","tr":"walillahi","en":"And for Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"مُلْكُ","tr":"mul'ku","en":"(is the) dominion","root":"ملك","lem":"مُلْك"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"(of) the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","tr":"wal-arḍi","en":"and the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","tr":"wayawma","en":"and (the) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"تَقُومُ","tr":"taqūmu","en":"is established","root":"قوم","lem":"قامَ"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ","tr":"l-sāʿatu","en":"the Hour","root":"سوع","lem":"ساعَة"},{"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","tr":"yawma-idhin","en":"that Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"يَخْسَرُ","tr":"yakhsaru","en":"will lose","root":"خسر","lem":"خَسِرَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُبْطِلُونَ","tr":"l-mub'ṭilūna","en":"the falsifiers","root":"بطل","lem":"مُبْطِل"}]},{"n":28,"juz":25,"ar":"وَتَرَىٰ كُلَّ أُمَّةٍ جَاثِيَةً ۚ كُلُّ أُمَّةٍ تُدْعَىٰٓ إِلَىٰ كِتَـٰبِهَا ٱلْيَوْمَ تُجْزَوْنَ مَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","en":"And you will see every nation kneeling [from fear]. Every nation will be called to its record [and told], \"Today you will be recompensed for what you used to do.","w":[{"ar":"وَتَرَىٰ","tr":"watarā","en":"And you will see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"كُلَّ","tr":"kulla","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"أُمَّةٍۢ","tr":"ummatin","en":"nation","root":"أمم","lem":"أُمَّة"},{"ar":"جَاثِيَةًۭ ۚ","tr":"jāthiyatan","en":"kneeling","root":"جثو","lem":"جاثِيَة"}